    <body>
      <div xml:id="gom-is8">
        <head xml:id="gom-is8-Hd1e98">Caput 8</head>
        <div xml:id="gom-is8-Dd1e100">
          <head xml:id="gom-is8-Hd1e102">Versus 1</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is8-d1e104">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is8-Qd1e106" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is8_1@1-7">Et dixit Dominus ad me: Sume tibi.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-is8-Rd1e109"><name xml:id="gom-is8-Nd1e110" ref="#Jerome">HIER.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is8-Qd1e113"><seg type="qs">Primum propheta praedicit Achaz futura</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">unde rursum partus virginalis describitur.</seg></quote>
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-is8-d1e121">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is8-Qd1e123" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is8_1@16-17">Velociter spolia.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-is8-Rd1e126"><name xml:id="gom-is8-Nd1e127" ref="#Jerome">ID.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is8-Qd1e130">Hoc nomen pueri, quasi diceret: Ne patiaris ultra diabolum regnare; et non angelos, non Prophetas mitte, sed ipse descende.</quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is8-Dd1e134">
          <head xml:id="gom-is8-Hd1e136">Versus 2</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is8-d1e138">
            <pb ed="#P" n="1246D"/>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is8-Qd1e142" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is8_2@6-6">Uriam,</quote>
            etc.
            <ref xml:id="gom-is8-Rd1e145"><name xml:id="gom-is8-Nd1e146" ref="#Jerome">ID.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is8-Qd1e149">Urias, lux Domini; Zacharias, memoria Domini; Barachias, benedictio Domini; his testibus nativitas Domini comprobatur. Unde duobus testibus euntibus in Emmaus incipiens a Moyse et prophetis, quae de se dicta erant, disseruit.</quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is8-Dd1e153">
          <head xml:id="gom-is8-Hd1e155">Versus 3</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is8-d1e157">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is8-Qd1e159" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is8_3@3-4">Ad prophetissam.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-is8-Rd1e162"><name xml:id="gom-is8-Nd1e163" ref="#Jerome">ID.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is8-Qd1e166">Ad Spiritum sanctum a quo omnis prophetia, quae Graece neutri generis pneuma, Hebraice feminini Ruach, Latine masculini generis est, et ideo diversis positionibus sortitur, nullius est enim. Vel ad Mariam, quam prophetissam fuisse nemo dubitat.</quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is8-Dd1e170">
          <head xml:id="gom-is8-Hd1e172">Versus 4</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is8-d1e174">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is8-Qd1e176" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is8_4@4-4">Puer.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-is8-Rd1e179"><name xml:id="gom-is8-Nd1e180" ref="#Jerome">ID.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is8-Qd1e183"><seg type="qs">Praecipitur itaque Isaias</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">domum David sola invocatione salvaret.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is8-Dd1e193">
          <head xml:id="gom-is8-Hd1e195">Versus 6</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is8-d1e197">
            <pb ed="#P" n="1247A"/>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is8-Qd1e201" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is8_6@1-8">Pro eo quod abjecit populus aquas Siole.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-is8-Rd1e204"><name xml:id="gom-is8-Nd1e205" ref="#Jerome">HIER.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is8-Qd1e208"><seg type="qs">In quibus caecus se lavit</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">terram ipsius Judam conatus sit possidere.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is8-Dd1e217">
          <head xml:id="gom-is8-Hd1e219">Versus 7</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is8-d1e221">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is8-Qd1e223" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is8_7@8-9">Aquas fluminis.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-is8-Rd1e226"><name xml:id="gom-is8-Nd1e227" ref="#Jerome">ID.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is8-Qd1e230">Exercitum Sennacherib, cujus potentia occupans terram Samariae inundationi fluminis comparatur.</quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is8-Dd1e234">
          <head xml:id="gom-is8-Hd1e236">Versus 9</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is8-d1e238">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is8-Qd1e240" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is8_9@1-2">Congregamini populi.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-is8-Rd1e243"><name xml:id="gom-is8-Nd1e244" ref="#Jerome">ID.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is8-Qd1e247"><seg type="qs">Quasi: Contra Emmanuel nihil potestis</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">quia perversitas non potest rectum superare.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is8-Dd1e256">
          <head xml:id="gom-is8-Hd1e258">Versus 12</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is8-d1e260">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is8-Qd1e262" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is8_12">Ne dicatis.</quote>
            <!-- check: lemma not matched to verse text -->
            <ref xml:id="gom-is8-Rd1e267"><name xml:id="gom-is8-Nd1e268" ref="#Jerome">ID.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is8-Qd1e271">Quasi diceret: Non timeatis duorum regum adversus Judam conjurationem: conjuratio est consensus multorum in malum.</quote>
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-is8-d1e274">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is8-Qd1e276" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is8_12@15-18">Ne timeatis neque paveatis.</quote>
            Tu et qui tecum sunt populi, quia videntur timendi; quia principium sapientiae <pb ed="#P" n="1247B"/> timor Domini.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is8-Dd1e283">
          <head xml:id="gom-is8-Hd1e285">Versus 14</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is8-d1e287">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is8-Qd1e289" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is8_14@6-7">In lapidem.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-is8-Rd1e292"><name xml:id="gom-is8-Nd1e293" ref="#Jerome">ID.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is8-Qd1e296"><seg type="qs">Quem reprobaverunt aedificantes</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">peccata peccatis sociantes et vincti laqueis delictorum.</seg></quote>
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-is8-d1e304">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is8-Qd1e306" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is8_14@14-15">Duabus domibus.</quote>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is8-Qd1e309"><seg type="qs">Vel in duabus familiis</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">per traditiones suas legis praecepta dissipaverunt et maculaverunt.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is8-Dd1e318">
          <head xml:id="gom-is8-Hd1e320">Versus 16</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is8-d1e322">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is8-Qd1e324" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is8_16@3-4">Signa legem.</quote>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is8-Qd1e327"><seg type="qs">Quasi diceret: Aperi eam, Domine, discipulis meis</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">possumus etiam doctrinas intelligere.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is8-Dd1e337">
          <head xml:id="gom-is8-Hd1e339">Versus 18</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is8-d1e341">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is8-Qd1e343" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is8_18">Pueri mei, ex Deo nati.</quote>
            <!-- check: lemma not matched to verse text -->
            <quote xml:id="gom-is8-Qd1e348"><seg type="qs">Alii Prophetae et eorum discipuli. Legunt hoc quidam de duobus filiis Isaiae</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">qui in portentum saecularis sapientiae et superbiae Judaeorum fuerunt.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is8-Dd1e357">
          <head xml:id="gom-is8-Hd1e359">Versus 20</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is8-d1e361">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is8-Qd1e363" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is8_20@14-16">Non eris eis.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-is8-Rd1e366"><name xml:id="gom-is8-Nd1e367" ref="#Jerome">ID.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is8-Qd1e370">Hoc est si populus <pb ed="#P" n="1247C"/> iste noluerit veritatem a Domino quaerere, non habebit Christum, scilicet lumen veritatis, quam negligit.</quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is8-Dd1e377">
          <head xml:id="gom-is8-Hd1e379">Versus 21</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is8-d1e381">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is8-Qd1e383" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is8_21@14-15">Regi suo.</quote>
            Diabolo et paternis traditionibus, id est, antiquis erroribus.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </body>
